<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Mwela Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 TIMOTEO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bhaluwa ja Bhili ja a Pauli kwa a Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 TMT</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bhaluwa ja Bhili ja a Pauli kwa a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoteo</para>
  <para style="imt">Shilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabhu sha 2 kwa a Timoteo ni bhaluwa ja bhili ja a Ntume a Pauli ku bhaajiganywa bhabho a Timoteo. Bhaluwa ja bhili ja a Timoteo pujajandikwe na a Pauli mobha ga tome na kuwa kwabho. Gene mobhago pubhaliji bhali bhatabhilwe ku Loma (1:16). A pauli pubhaliji na shilongani sha punda na a Timoteo na kaje pubhaashemaga bhana bhabho (Bhapilipi 2:22, 1:2, 1:18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Jejino ni bhaluwa jimo munkumbi gwa bhaluwa nsheshe ibhajandishe a Pauli kwa mena ga bhandu, kuleka lina lya Likanisha. Itatu ina ya yene bhaluwayo ni, 1 Timoteo na Tito na Pilimoni. Malanga pujajandikwe bhaluwa ja bhili kwa a Timoteo, Bhakilishitu bha muutawala gwa Loma bhatendaga potekwanga. Genego ni gapeleshele a Pauli bhatabhwe, na a Timoteo bhatendaga kwiipililila na gwene ukomugo. Malinga mmaluwa ja ntai ja kwa a Timoteo, a Pauli bhanakwaaleya a Timoteo ga bhaajiganya bha unami (1 Timoteo 1:16-18). Na kabhili a Pauli bhanakwaalugulila a Timoteo kuti ganakwiya mobha ga shilaje (3:1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ipali Mwenemo</para>
  <para style="io">1. A Pauli bhanaatandubha kwa kwaalamushila a Timoteo (1:1-2) na kabhili bhanakwaataga ntima (1:3-18).</para>
  <para style="io">2. Kabhili a Pauli bhanakwaakwiya a Timoteo ga kwiipililila (2:1-13).</para>
  <para style="io">3. A Pauli bhanakwaapa a Timoteo malajilo gana ga pamo (2:14-26). 4, Kungai a Pauli bhanakwaaleya a Timoteo ga indu ikwiya na namuna ja mmbone ja tenda.</para>
  <para style="io">4. A Pauli bhanamalishiya kwa matalashiyo gabho bhayene kwa a Timoteo (4:9-24).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1"/>
  <para style="s">Shalamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1"/>Nne a Pauli, kwa pinga kwabho a Nnungu, njemilwe kubha ntume jwa a Yeshu Kilishitu, nkupinga nunguye ga gumi gubhalajile a Nnungu tupegwe, nkulundana na a Yeshu Kilishitu, <verse eid="2TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2"/>ngunakunnjandishila mmwe mmanangu a Timoteo bhungumpinga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Ngunakumpinjila mboka, na shiya, na ulele ikoposhela kwa Atati a Nnungu, na a Yeshu Kilishitu Bhakulungwa bhetu.<verse eid="2TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutenda Eja na Tagwa Ntima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3"/>Ngunakwaatendela eja a Nnungu bhungwatendela liengo kwa ntima gwa mmbone malinga shibhatendangaga ashaambuje bhukala, ngunakwaatendela eja kila pungunkumbushila mmwe mobha gowe, nkujuga kwangu shilo na mui. <verse eid="2TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4"/>Pungukumbushila minyoi jenu, ngunalokolila kummona nkupinga kuangalala kwangu kupunde. <verse eid="2TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5"/>Ngunakumbushila ngulupai jenu ja kweli, ngulupai jatandubhile kwa anakulu bhenu a Loishi na anyinabhenu a Eunike. Kwa nneyo ngunakulupalila kuti, jipali nkali kwenu mmwe. <verse eid="2TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6"/>Kwa nneyo ngunakunkumbushiya kuti nkwiye shipaji sha a Nnungu, shimposhele punammishile makono. <verse eid="2TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7"/>Pabha a Nnungu bhangatupa Mbumu jwa bhoga, ikabhe Mbumu jwa mashili, na jwa pingana, na jwa kwiitimalika.<verse eid="2TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8"/>Bhai nnakole oni kong'ondela ga Bhakulungwa bhetu, nkali kungolela oni nne ndabhilwe kwa ligongo lyabho. Ikabheje mme pamo na nne mmboteko kwa ligongo lya Ngani ja Mmbone, malinga shinkupegwa mashili na a Nnungu. <verse eid="2TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9"/>Bhene bhatutapwile nikutushema tubhe tubhandu bhabho bha ukonjelo, nngabha kwa ligongo lya itendi yetu, ikabhe kwa ligongo lya pinga kwabho na nema jabho bhayene. Jene nemaji twashinkupegwa nkulundana na a Yeshu Kilishitu kuumila bhukalago. <verse eid="2TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10"/>Kwa nneyo, jene nemaji nnaino jishiibhulwa bhakayuyweje bhaatapula bhetu a Yeshu Kilishitu. Bhenebho bhashikugapeya mashili ga shiwo, nipeleshela gumi gwa pitipiti kwa Ngani ja Mmbone.<verse eid="2TI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11"/>Kwa ligongo lya jene Ngani ja Mmboneji, nne njiagulwa kubha nkulunguya, na ntume na nkujiganya. <verse eid="2TI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12"/>Kwa ligongo lya genego, nne ngunapotekwa, nkali nneyo ngakola oni, pabha naamanyi bhene bhungwaakulupalila bhala, numbe nimumanyi kuti shibhashibhishile ulinda shene shibhambele shila, mpaka kuishila lyubha lya mpelo. <verse eid="2TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13"/>Nkamulile ukoto majiganyo ga kweli guninnjigenye gala, na ngulupai na nkupingana kwa nkulundana na a Yeshu Kilishitu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14"/>Kwa Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo atama nkati jetu, nshibhishile ulinda shene shindu sha mmbone shimpegwilwe shila.<verse eid="2TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15"/>Malinga shimmumanyi kuti bhandu bhowe bha ku Ashia, bhaneshilenje, munkumbi gwabhonji bhaapali a Pigelo na a Elimogene. <verse eid="2TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16"/>Bhakulungwa bhaabhonelanje shiya bha ulongo bha a Oneshipolashi, pabha bhatendaga ndaga ntima wala bhakakolaga oni ga tabhwa kwangu. <verse eid="2TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17"/>Ikabhe bhakaisheje ku Loma, gubhatumbile kunoleya, mpaka gubhamweni. <verse eid="2TI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18"/>Bhakulungwa a Yeshu bhaabhonele shiya sha a Nnungu lyene lyubhalyo! Na mmwe mmumanyi indu yaigwinji ibhandendele ku Epesho kula.<verse eid="2TI 1:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Linjola jwa Mmbone jwa a Yeshu Kilishitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1"/>Bhai ugwe mwanangu, ukole mashili kwa nema jitupegwa nkulundana na a Yeshu Kilishitu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2"/>Na majiganyo gumpilikene ngulijiganya pa bhaakong'ondela bhabhagwinji, numbe mmwe mwaajiganyanje bhandunji bhaakulupalika, bhaakombolanga kwaajiganyanga bhananji.<verse eid="2TI 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3"/>Gwiilunde mmboteko pamo na nne, malinga nkomana ngondo jwa mmbone jwa a Yeshu Kilishitu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4"/>Linjola pabha nkukomana ngondo akakwiibhuka nkukamula maengo gana, pabha shaapinga ni kwaanonyeya bhakulungwa bha likundi lyakwe. <verse eid="2TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5"/>Nneyo peyo mundu apwatanila upo mwiing'ando, akapegwa upo ya kombola monaga jwangakaguya ikubho ya nng'andogo. <verse eid="2TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6"/>Mundu atumbila kulima, ni apinjikwa abhe jwantai kupata shipeta sha mauno. <verse eid="2TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7"/>Nnganishiye kaje malobhe gungummalanjila gano, pabha Bhakulungwa shibhampe lumanyio lwa kugamanya gowe.<verse eid="2TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8"/>Mwaakumbushile a Yeshu Kilishitu bhayushiywe bhakaweje, bha shipinga sha a Daudi, malinga shijitaya Ngani ja Mmbone jingulunguya jino. <verse eid="2TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9"/>Kwa lyene ligongolyo ngunapotekwa nitabhwa mbuti nkulebha, ikabheje lilobhe lya a Nnungu likatabhwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10"/>Kwa nneyo ngunakwiipililila gowe, kwa ligongo lya bhandunji bhaagwilwenje na a Nnungu, nkupinga na bhalabhonji bhapatanje ntapulo nkulundana na a Yeshu Kilishitu, na ukonjelo gwa pitipiti. <verse eid="2TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11"/>Na malobhe ga kulupalika gakuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">“Monaga tuwile pamo na bhenebho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">nneyo peyo shitulame pamo na bhenebho.<verse eid="2TI 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12"/>Monaga shituipililile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">shitutagwale pamo na bhenebho.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">Na ibhaga shitwaakane bhenebho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">na bhalabho shibhatukane uwe.<verse eid="2TI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13"/>Nkali tubhe bhangakulupalilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">bhenebho ni bhaakulupalikape,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">pabha ikaakomboleka kwiikana bhayene.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nkamula Maengo Apingwa na a Nnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14"/>Bhai, mwaakumbushiyanje bhandu gene malobhego, na mwaaleyanje pa meyo ga a Nnungu, bhanakolanje malobhe ga mitau, pabha gangali mana, ikabhe ganapuganya bhaapilikananga. <verse eid="2TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15"/>Ntumbile kwiilanguya kwa a Nnungu kuti mmaakulupalika, ntumishi jwangali oni, nnilunguya kwa aki ntenga gwa kweli gwa a Nnungu. <verse eid="2TI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16"/>Mwiembuye na nkungulu gwangali mana na gwa shingumba, pabha ganakwaashoyanga bhandunji nngulupai niileka kwaajogopa a Nnungu. <verse eid="2TI 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17"/>Majiganyo gabhonji ganajambushiya malinga libhanga shilijenela nshiilu, munkumbi gwabhonji bhapalinji a Imenayo na a Piletushi. <verse eid="2TI 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18"/>Bhanganyabho bhapuganikenje niileka ya kweli, bhalinkutinji kuyuywa kwa bhandunji kupitile, nipuganya ngulupai ya bhandu bhabhagwinji. <verse eid="2TI 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19"/>Ikabheje a Nnungu bhabhishile ishi ya nyumba, ishimilishwe kwa olela ukoto, na gene malobhe gano, gashijandikwa pantundu yene ishii, “Bhakulungwa bhaamanyi bhandunji bhabho,” na kabhili, “Kila ashema lina lya Bhakulungwa, aleshe ilebho.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20"/>Nnyumba jikulungwa ikaapagwa indu ya shaabhu na ela pe, ikabhe na indu ya mikongo na ya lilongo, ina ya tendela maengo gamashoko ina ya maengo gamakulungwa. <verse eid="2TI 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21"/>Bhai mundu aikonjeleyaga niileka ilebho, shaabhe mundu jwa maengo gamakulungwa, sha ukonjelo shibhishilwe na bhayene nyumba, shaapwae kwa kila liengo lya mmbone.<verse eid="2TI 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22"/>Mwiembuye na ilokoli ya ushanda, nkagulile uguja na ngulupai na kupingana na ulele, pamo na bhene bhakwaajuganga Bhakulungwa kwa ntima gwa mmbone. <verse eid="2TI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23"/>Mwiembuye na mitau ja shingumba na jangali mana, pabha mmumanyi kuti yeneyo inakumbuya mipwai. <verse eid="2TI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24"/>Numbe ntumishi jwa Bhakulungwa akapinjikwa kubha jwa mipwai, ikabhe jwa kwiitimalika kubhandu bhowe, akombola kujiganya na kwiipililila. <verse eid="2TI 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25"/>Anapinjikwa kwaaleyanga kwa kwiitimalika bhakuntaukanga, pana a Nnungu shibhaajalianje kwiipeta nikagula ya kweli. <verse eid="2TI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26"/>Nkupinga lunda lwabhonji lwaabhujilanje kabhili nikolobhoka nniyau lika Lishetani, lyabhatanjiyenje nkupinga bhatendanje yapinga jwenejo.<verse eid="2TI 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Atali ya Mobha ga Kumpelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1"/>Ikabheje nnapinjikwa mmumanye kuti mobha ga kumpelo shigabhe ga atali. <verse eid="2TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2"/>Pabha, bhandunji shibhabhanganje bhakwiipinganga ashayenenji, na bhapinganga mmbiya, na bhakwiiniyanga, na bha mbwinya, na bhaatukananga, na bhakakwaakundanga bhaakwetenje, na bhakaapinganga kutenda eja, na bhangalinginji bha mmbone. <verse eid="2TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3"/>Shibhakoposhelanje bhandunji bhakakwaapinganga ashaalongo ajabhonji, na bhakaapinganga kumaliya mipwai, na bhalambililanga, na bhakakwiitimalikanga, na bha kolanga nngomo, na bhakaapinganga kutenda ya mmbone, <verse eid="2TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4"/>bhaatendebhukana, na bhamitau, na bhakwiipunanga, na bhapinganga ya manong'a, kupunda kwaapinga a Nnungu. <verse eid="2TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5"/>Bhalinginji mbuti bhakwaatindibhalilanga a Nnungu, ikabheje bhalikananga mashili ga a Nnungu, mwiembuye na bhene bhanganyabho.<verse eid="2TI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6"/>Pabha munkumbi gwabhonji bhapalinji bhaowelanga mmajumba ga bhandu, nikwaatekeyanga bhanabhakongwe bhangalinginji lunda, bhakwetenje mishigo ja ilebho na ilokoli yaigwinji, <verse eid="2TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7"/>bhene bhanabhakongwebho bhalikwiijiganyanga mobha gowe, ikabheje bhakakolanga lunda lwa kuimanya indu ya kweli. <verse eid="2TI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8"/>Ni malinga a Yaneshi na a Yambuleshi bhaataukenje a Musha, nneyo peyo na bhene bhaataukanga indu ya mmbone, bhandu bhaangabhanikenje lunda lwabhonji, bhakanilwenje nngulupai. <verse eid="2TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9"/>Ikabheje bhakapundanga kutenda nneyo, pabha ubhelu gwabhonji shigumanyishe na bhandu bhowe, malinga puyaliji kwa a Yane na a Yambule.<verse eid="2TI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malajilo ga Kumpelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10"/>Ikabheje mmwe nkagwile majiganyo na ndamo jangu, na ng'aniyo na ngulupai yangu, na kwiitimalika kwangu, na kupingana na kwiipililila kwangu, <verse eid="2TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11"/>ga mboteko na laga. Yani ku Antiokia, na ku Ikonio, na ku Lishitila, na gowe ga jogoya gunaipililile! Ikabheje Bhakulungwa gubhandapwile mowemo. <verse eid="2TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12"/>Bhai, bhowe bhaapinganga kutama nkwaakulupalila a Kilishitu Yeshu, shibhapotekwanje. <verse eid="2TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13"/>Bhandu bha ilebho, na bha unami shibhapundanje kutenda ilebho, bhalitembanga na tembwanga. <verse eid="2TI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14"/>Ikabheje, mmwe ntame mmajiganyo gunnjigenywe nikugaposhela ukoto gala, pabha mwaamanyinji bhannjigenyenje bhala. <verse eid="2TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15"/>Numbe kuumila pumwaliji mmashoko mwagamanyi Majandiko ga Ukonjelo, ga kumpa ng'aniyo ya lunda ya kuntapula kwa ngulupai ya nkulundana na a Yeshu Kilishitu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16"/>Majandiko gowe gajandikwe nkulongoywa na Mbumu jwa a Nnungu, ganapwaa nkujiganya na nkuleya bhandu muilebho yabhonji, na kwaalongoyanga, nikwaapanganga aki, <verse eid="2TI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17"/>nkupinga mundu jwa a Nnungu atimilile, na aengwe kutenda maengo gowe ga mmbone.<verse eid="2TI 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4"/>
  <para style="s">Malajilo ga Kumpelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1"/>Ngunakunnajila pa meyo ga a Nnungu na a Yeshu Kilishitu, bhaapinga kwaukumulanga bhandunji bhabhakoto na bhawilenje, pene pushibhaishe mu upalume gwabho. <verse eid="2TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2"/>Nnunguye lyene lilobheli, na nnjime ukoto mobha gowe, gapwaa na ganngapwaa, na nkalipile, na nnimbiye, na mwaaleyanje bhandu nnikwaajiganyanga kwiitimalika. <verse eid="2TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3"/>Pabha shigaishe mobha gushibhakananje majiganyo ga kweli ga gumi, ikabheje shibhakagulilanje ng'aniyo yabhonji, nikwiigumbashiya bhaajiganya bhabhonji bhabhagwinji, nkupinga bhapilikananje indu ikwaanonyelanga. <verse eid="2TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4"/>Numbe shibhakananje kupilikanishiya malobhe ga kweli, nitendebhushila ndango ya unami. <verse eid="2TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5"/>Ikabheje mmwe ntame nkwiitimalika na indu yowe, mwiipililile mmboteko, nkamule liengo lya lunguya Ngani ja Mmbone, mmalishiye liengo lyenu.<verse eid="2TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6"/>Pabha, nnaino nne ngunashoywa mbuti mbepei, malanga gangu gawa gaishile. <verse eid="2TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7"/>Njikomana ngondo ja mmbone ja ngulupai, mwanja nigumaliye, na njikamulila ukoto ngulupai. <verse eid="2TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8"/>Nnaino, njibhishilwa shilemba sha aki shishibhambe Bhakulungwa lyene lyubhalyo, numbe ngabha nne pe nne, ikabheje na bhandu bhowe nkwaapinga bhanalolelanga kuika kwabho.<verse eid="2TI 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malajilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9"/>Ntende shangu kwiya akuno. <verse eid="2TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10"/>Pabha a Dema ga pinga indu ya pa shilambolyo, bhashineka gubhapite ku Teshalonike, na a Keleshike gubhapite ku Galatia, na a Tito bhapite ku Dalimatia. <verse eid="2TI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11"/>Bhali na nne apano, ni a Luka jikape. Mwaaloleye a Maliko, nnjiye nabho, pabha bhananyanguta mmaengo. <verse eid="2TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12"/>A Tikiko naatumile ku Epesho. <verse eid="2TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13"/>Pushinnjiyepo nnyigalile likoti lyangu lineshile kwa a Kalipashi bha ku Toloa, nnyigalile na itabhu, na kaje ya mapende ila.<verse eid="2TI 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14"/>A Alekishanda bha yana itale bhala, bhashindendela ya nyata yaigwinji, Bhakulungwa shibhaalipe kwa itendi yabho. <verse eid="2TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15"/>Na mmwe mwiiteije na bhenebho, pabha bhashinkutauka kwa puya malobhe getu.<verse eid="2TI 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16"/>Punaibheleketelaga malobhe ga kwiitapula gwa ntai, jwakwa mundu ajimi na nne kunyangutila, ikabhe bhowe bhashinkunekanga, nne ngunakwaajujilanga kwa a Nnungu bhaleshelelwanje, na bhanabhonekanje kulebha kwa genego! <verse eid="2TI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17"/>Ikabheje Bhakulungwa gubhajimi na nne, nigubhambele mashili, nkupinga nunguye ntenga gula ukoto, nkali ku bhandu bha ilambo ina, na nne gundapwilwe nshiwo, mbuti ngutapulwa nkang'wa ja imba. <verse eid="2TI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18"/>Bhakulungwa shibhandapule na indu yowe ya nyata, shibhandole ng'ishe ku Upalume gwabho gwa ku nnungu. Ukonjelo ni gwabho pitipiti! Amina.<verse eid="2TI 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shalamu sha Kumpelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19"/>Mwaalamushilanje a Pilishika na a Akula na bhandunji bha munngwabho a Oneshipolashi. <verse eid="2TI 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20"/>A Elashito kubhatama ku Kolinto, na a Tolopimo kunaaleshile ku Mileto, bhalwele.<verse eid="2TI 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21"/>Ntende shangu kwiya akuno, gakanabhe ishila mobha ga mmbepo. A Ebhulo bhanakunnamushilanga, na a Pudenishi na a Linushi, na a Kilaudia, na Bhakilishitu bhowe.<verse eid="2TI 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22"/>Bhakulungwa bhatame muntima gwenu. Nema jitame na mmanganyanji mmowe.<verse eid="2TI 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4"/>
</usx>
